###  https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/MILD/MILD_120001
<https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/MILD/MILD_120001> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                rdfs:subClassOf <https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/MILD/MILD_120020> ,
                                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
